-- Value City E-Commerce System
-- SEED DATA: Lei's local test products (49 items), exported for the team
-- to import so everyone's testing against the same catalog.
--
-- IMPORTANT: run add_more_categories.sql FIRST (Shoes/Bags/Books/Toys/
-- Kitchenware need to exist) -- this file looks up each product's
-- category by NAME, not by raw ID, specifically so it works correctly
-- no matter what numeric IDs your local categories table happens to have
-- assigned. If a category name isn't found, category_id is left NULL for
-- that row instead of failing the whole import.
--
-- Product IDs are intentionally NOT included -- MySQL just auto-assigns
-- fresh ones. This avoids clashing with any test products you already
-- added locally under the same IDs.
--
-- In phpMyAdmin: select the value_city_admin database, then run this
-- file's SQL tab.

USE value_city_admin;

